      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-- Keeping workflow state size in check -- when fail, we need to rerun the entire activities,\nwhich can make workflow state grow very large and very quickly\n1) Minimize size of activity input and result. \n2) Periodically snapshot long-running workflow and hand off to fresh copy of itself.\nTemporal call this \"Continue-as-New\". The new run starts at the current position, not back at step 1.\n\nAnother example, Uber finding ride also can be temporal\n\n\n\n ",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-- Keeping workflow state size in check -- when fail, we need to rerun the entire activities,\nwhich can make workflow state grow very large and very quickly\n1) Minimize size of activity input and result. \n2) Periodically snapshot long-running workflow and hand off to fresh copy of itself.\nTemporal call this \"Continue-as-New\". The new run starts at the current position, not back at step 1.\n\nAnother example, Uber finding ride also can be temporal\n\n\n\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
